The task is to create a web application using the Fastify framework that provides an invite-only user registration service. The application will have two main endpoints: one for generating invitation IDs for new users and another for creating user accounts using those invitation IDs. The application must ensure that each email can only receive one invitation and that user inputs are validated and securely handled.

### Summary of the Plan:
