4. Implement the `/create_user` endpoint, validating the invitation ID and ensuring that the username is unique and adheres to the specified length constraints.
5. Use parameterized queries for all database interactions to enhance security against SQL injection.
6. Start the Fastify server on port 5000, ensuring it listens for incoming requests while adhering to the security guidelines throughout the implementation process.

